<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600&amp;family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400&amp;display=swap">
<title>BDO Game Pilot</title>
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="apple-touch-icon.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="favicon-32x32.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="favicon-16x16.png">
<link rel="manifest" href="site.webmanifest">
<style>
:root { color-scheme: light dark; }
:root[data-theme="light"] { color-scheme: light; }
:root[data-theme="dark"] { color-scheme: dark; }
:root {
  --bg: light-dark(#ffffff, #121212);
  --fg: light-dark(#1a1a1a, #ededed);
  --ctl: light-dark(#f3f3f3, #262626);
  --bd: light-dark(#6b6b6b, #9a9a9a);
  --sel-bg: light-dark(#1a1a1a, #ededed);
  --sel-fg: light-dark(#ffffff, #121212);
}
body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg); }
button, input, textarea { background: var(--ctl); color: var(--fg); border: 1px solid var(--bd); }
fieldset { border: 1px solid var(--bd); }
[aria-selected="true"] { background: var(--sel-bg); color: var(--sel-fg); }

/* Font */
:root {
  --font-ui: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
  --font-mono: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace;
}

/* Responsive */
*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
[hidden] { display: none !important; }
html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-size-adjust: 100%; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  padding: clamp(0.75rem, 3vw, 2rem);
  font: 0.9375rem/1.6 var(--font-ui);
  overflow-wrap: break-word;
}
header, main { width: 100%; max-width: 52rem; margin-inline: auto; }
h1 { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 1rem + 1.2vw, 1.75rem); line-height: 1.2; }
h1 a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
h2 { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 0.95rem + 0.5vw, 1.25rem); line-height: 1.3; }

button {
  min-height: 2.75rem;
  padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
  font: inherit;
  font-weight: 600;
  border-radius: 0.5rem;
  cursor: pointer;
}
nav[role="tablist"] {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 12rem), 1fr));
  gap: 0.5rem;
  margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
}

main > section { min-width: 0; }
fieldset { min-width: 0; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem 0.25rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; }
legend { padding: 0 0.5rem; font-weight: 600; }
fieldset fieldset { margin: 0 0 0.9rem; }
p { margin: 0 0 0.9rem; }
p:has(> label:first-child) { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 0.35rem; }
label { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

input, textarea {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 2.75rem;
  padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
  font: inherit;
  border-radius: 0.5rem;
}
textarea { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; resize: none; }
code, samp { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.9em; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
summary { display: list-item; min-height: 2.75rem; padding: 0.5rem 0; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }
ul { padding-inline-start: 1.25rem; }
li { margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
p > button + button { margin-inline-start: 0.5rem; }
header > button + button { margin-inline-start: 0.5rem; }

dialog {
  width: min(24rem, calc(100% - 2rem));
  max-height: calc(100% - 2rem);
  overflow: auto;
  padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--fg);
  border: 1px solid var(--bd);
  border-radius: 0.5rem;
}
dialog::backdrop { background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); }
dialog ul {list-style: none; padding-left: 0; }
dialog a { display: inline-block; padding: 0.25rem 0; }

#note-images {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 18rem), 1fr));
  gap: 1rem;
  margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
}
input[type="range"] { padding: 0; border: 0; background: transparent; }
input[type="checkbox"] { display: inline-block; width: 1.1rem; height: 1.1rem; min-height: 0; margin: 0 0.35rem 0 0; padding: 0; vertical-align: middle; }
input:disabled { opacity: 0.55; cursor: not-allowed; }
.up { color: light-dark(#0b6b2b, #6fe39a); }
.down { color: light-dark(#b00020, #ff8a8a); }
figure { min-width: 0; margin: 0; }
img { display: block; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border: 1px solid var(--bd); border-radius: 0.5rem; }
figcaption { margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.875rem; }

details p:has(> label:only-child) { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
details p:has(> label:only-child) > label { padding-top: 0; }

@media (hover: none) and (pointer: coarse) {
  input { font-size: 1rem; }
}
@media (min-width: 40rem) {
  p:has(> label:first-child) { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 15rem) minmax(0, 1fr); align-items: start; gap: 0.35rem 1rem; }
  p:has(> label:first-child) > label { padding-top: 0.5rem; }
}
</style>
<script>
try { var saved = localStorage.getItem("theme"); if (saved === "light" || saved === "dark") document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-theme", saved); } catch (e) {}
</script>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1><a href="./">BDO Game Pilot</a></h1>
<button type="button" id="theme-toggle"><span id="theme-icon" aria-hidden="true">☾</span> <span id="theme-label">Mode Gelap</span></button>
<button type="button" id="help-open" aria-haspopup="dialog"><span aria-hidden="true">?</span> <span>Help</span></button>
<nav role="tablist" aria-label="Tab">
<button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-stopwatch" aria-controls="panel-stopwatch" aria-selected="true">Google Stopwatch</button>
<button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-hourly" aria-controls="panel-hourly" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Progress Hourly (Tanpa Agris)</button>
<button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-agris" aria-controls="panel-agris" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Progress Hourly (Dengan Agris)</button>
<button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-total" aria-controls="panel-total" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Total Progress Hourly</button>
<button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-buff" aria-controls="panel-buff" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Buff Counter</button>
<button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-tax" aria-controls="panel-tax" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">BDO Tax Calculator</button>
<button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-totaltl" aria-controls="panel-totaltl" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Total TL</button>
<button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-compen" aria-controls="panel-compen" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Compen</button>
<button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-silver" aria-controls="panel-silver" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Silver</button>
<button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-grinding" aria-controls="panel-grinding" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Grinding Spot</button>
<button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-used" aria-controls="panel-used" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Agris Used</button>
<button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-ascendant" aria-controls="panel-ascendant" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Ascendant</button>
</nav>
</header>
<main>

<!-- Google Stopwatch -->
<section role="tabpanel" id="panel-stopwatch" aria-labelledby="tab-stopwatch">
<h2>Google Stopwatch</h2>
<div id="form-stopwatch">
<fieldset>
<legend>Input (H:MM:SS)</legend>
<p><label for="sw-h">Jam (H)</label> <input type="text" inputmode="decimal" id="sw-h" name="h" value="8" required></p>
<p><label for="sw-m">Menit (MM)</label> <input type="text" inputmode="decimal" id="sw-m" name="m" value="45" required></p>
<p><label for="sw-s">Detik (SS)</label> <input type="text" inputmode="decimal" id="sw-s" name="s" value="21" required></p>
<p><button type="button" id="reset-stopwatch">Reset</button> <button type="button" id="clear-stopwatch">Clear</button></p>
</fieldset>
<p><label for="sw-out"><strong>Paste di browser console</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="sw-out" name="out" rows="8" cols="80" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><strong>Note:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Buka tab baru, search <code>Stopwatch</code> di Google</li>
<li>Play dulu 1–3 detik, yang penting stopwatch udah jalan</li>
<li>Buka browser console, tekan <strong>F12</strong></li>
<li>Paste, ketik <code>allow pasting</code> terus enter jika tidak bisa paste</li>
<li>Jika <strong>F12</strong> membuka tab <em>Elements</em>, klik pada tab <em>Console</em> untuk membuka browser console</li>
</ul>
<figure>
<img src="browser-console.png" alt="Screenshot browser console" loading="lazy">
</figure>
</div>
</section>

<!-- Progress Hourly no Agris -->
<section role="tabpanel" id="panel-hourly" aria-labelledby="tab-hourly" hidden>
<h2>Progress Hourly (Tanpa Agris)</h2>
<div id="form-hourly">
<fieldset>
<legend>Input</legend>
<p><label for="h-total">Total TL:</label> <input type="text" inputmode="decimal" id="h-total" name="total" value="97,000"></p>
<p><label for="h-rate">TL per jam (note):</label> <input type="text" inputmode="decimal" id="h-rate" name="rate" value="11,000"></p>
<p><button type="button" id="reset-hourly">Reset</button> <button type="button" id="clear-hourly">Clear</button></p>
</fieldset>
<p><label for="h-out">Progress:</label> <textarea id="h-out" name="progress" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><strong>Contoh:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Total perolehan TL dalam satu shift: <code>97,000</code></li>
<li><em>TL per jam sesuai patokan yang ada di note: <code>11,000</code></em></li>
<li>Progress: <samp>8 Hours 49 Minutes 5 Seconds</samp></li>
</ul>
<details>
<summary>Perhitungan</summary>
<p><label for="h-s1">Total TL dibagi TL per jam <strong>(waktu dalam jam)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="h-s1" name="h-s1" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="h-s2">Waktu dalam jam dikali <code>3600</code>, <em>dibulatkan ke bawah</em> <strong>(total detik)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="h-s2" name="h-s2" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="h-s3">Total detik dibagi <code>3600</code>, <em>dibulatkan ke bawah</em> <strong style="color: #dc3545;">(jam)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="h-s3" name="h-s3" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="h-s4">Sisa total detik dibagi <code>3600</code>, lalu dibagi <code>60</code> dan <em>dibulatkan ke bawah</em> <strong style="color: #dc3545;">(menit)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="h-s4" name="h-s4" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="h-s5">Sisa total detik dibagi <code>60</code> <strong style="color: #dc3545;">(detik)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="h-s5" name="h-s5" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
</details>
</div>
</section>

<!-- Progress Hourly with Agris -->
<section role="tabpanel" id="panel-agris" aria-labelledby="tab-agris" hidden>
<h2>Progress Hourly (Dengan Agris)</h2>
<div id="form-agris">
<fieldset>
<legend>Input</legend>
<p><label for="a-total">Total TL:</label> <input type="text" inputmode="decimal" id="a-total" name="total" value="110,000"></p>
<fieldset>
<legend>Patokan Agris</legend>
<p><label for="a-rate">TL/hr dengan Agris (note):</label> <input type="text" inputmode="decimal" id="a-rate" name="rate" value="19,000"></p>
<p><label for="a-cost">Agris yang digunakan per jam (note):</label> <input type="text" inputmode="decimal" id="a-cost" name="cost" value="32,000"></p>
</fieldset>
<p><label for="a-normal">TL/hr tanpa Agris (note):</label> <input type="text" inputmode="decimal" id="a-normal" name="normal" value="11,000"></p>
<p><label for="a-current">Agris yang digunakan selama shift:</label> <input type="text" inputmode="decimal" id="a-current" name="current" value="55,000"></p>
<p><button type="button" id="reset-agris">Reset</button> <button type="button" id="clear-agris">Clear</button></p>
</fieldset>
<p><label for="a-out">Total Time:</label> <textarea id="a-out" name="total-time" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="a-with">Time with Agris:</label> <textarea id="a-with" name="time-with-agris" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="a-without">Time without Agris:</label> <textarea id="a-without" name="time-without-agris" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><strong>Note:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Harus ada patokan <em>Agris yang digunakan</em> dan <em>total TL</em> per jam</li>
</ul>
<div id="note-images">
<figure>
<img src="tidak-bisa-di-hitung.png" alt="Screenshot TL yang tidak bisa dihitung" loading="lazy">
<figcaption><strong>Tidak bisa dihitung.</strong> Pada kotak merah yang ada di note, hanya TL per jam dengan Agris saja yang diketahui, sedangkan Agris yang digunakan per jam tidak ada. Tanpa patokan itu, perhitungannya tidak akan menampilkan hasil. Solusinya, <em>grinding sendiri dengan Agris berdasarkan TL per jam yang ada di note</em>.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure>
<img src="bisa-di-hitung.png" alt="Screenshot TL yang bisa dihitung" loading="lazy">
<figcaption><strong>Bisa dihitung.</strong> Pada kotak biru yang ada di note, ada patokan Agris yang digunakan per jam beserta TL per jamnya. Dengan kedua patokan ini, <em>perhitungan total time, time with Agris, dan time without Agris</em> dapat dijalankan dan tidak akan menampilkan error.</figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
<p>Contoh:</p>
<ul>
<li>Total TL selama shift: <code>110,000</code></li>
<li><em>Note dari TL per jam pake Agris: <code>19,000</code></em></li>
<li><em>Note dari TL per jam berapa Agris: <code>32,000</code></em></li>
<li><em>Note dari TL per jam tanpa Agris: <code>11,000</code></em></li>
<li>Agris yang digunakan selama shift: <code>55,000</code></li>
<li>Total Time: <samp>8 Hours 45 Minutes 0 Seconds</samp></li>
<li>Time with Agris: <samp>1 Hours 43 Minutes 7 Seconds</samp></li>
<li>Time without Agris: <samp>7 Hours 1 Minutes 52 Seconds</samp></li>
</ul>
<details>
<summary>Perhitungan</summary>
<p><label for="a-s1">Agris yang digunakan selama shift dibagi dengan patokan Agris yang digunakan per jam <strong>(maks jam Agris)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="a-s1" name="a-s1" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="a-s2">Maks jam Agris dikali dengan patokan TL/hr dengan Agris <strong>(maks TL Agris)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="a-s2" name="a-s2" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="a-s3">Total TL dibandingkan dengan Maks TL Agris <strong>(≤ berarti Agris cukup, > berarti Agris tidak cukup)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="a-s3" name="a-s3" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="a-s4" id="a-l4">(Total TL dikurangi Maks TL Agris) dibagi dengan patokan TL/hr tanpa Agris <strong>(waktu without Agris, dalam jam)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="a-s4" name="a-s4" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="a-s5">Waktu with Agris ditambah waktu without Agris <strong>(total waktu, dalam jam)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="a-s5" name="a-s5" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<fieldset>
<legend>Total Time</legend>
<p><label for="a-t1">Waktu dalam jam dikali <code>3600</code>, <em>dibulatkan ke bawah</em> <strong>(total detik)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="a-t1" name="a-t1" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="a-t2">Total detik dibagi <code>3600</code>, <em>dibulatkan ke bawah</em> <strong style="color: #dc3545;">(jam)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="a-t2" name="a-t2" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="a-t3">Sisa total detik dibagi <code>3600</code>, lalu dibagi <code>60</code> dan <em>dibulatkan ke bawah</em> <strong style="color: #dc3545;">(menit)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="a-t3" name="a-t3" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="a-t4">Sisa total detik dibagi <code>60</code> <strong style="color: #dc3545;">(detik)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="a-t4" name="a-t4" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
</fieldset>
<fieldset>
<legend>Time with Agris</legend>
<p><label for="a-w1">Waktu dalam jam dikali <code>3600</code>, <em>dibulatkan ke bawah</em> <strong>(total detik)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="a-w1" name="a-w1" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="a-w2">Total detik dibagi <code>3600</code>, <em>dibulatkan ke bawah</em> <strong style="color: #dc3545;">(jam)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="a-w2" name="a-w2" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="a-w3">Sisa total detik dibagi <code>3600</code>, lalu dibagi <code>60</code> dan <em>dibulatkan ke bawah</em> <strong style="color: #dc3545;">(menit)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="a-w3" name="a-w3" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="a-w4">Sisa total detik dibagi <code>60</code> <strong style="color: #dc3545;">(detik)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="a-w4" name="a-w4" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
</fieldset>
<fieldset>
<legend>Time without Agris</legend>
<p><label for="a-o1">Waktu dalam jam dikali <code>3600</code>, <em>dibulatkan ke bawah</em> <strong>(total detik)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="a-o1" name="a-o1" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="a-o2">Total detik dibagi <code>3600</code>, <em>dibulatkan ke bawah</em> <strong style="color: #dc3545;">(jam)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="a-o2" name="a-o2" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="a-o3">Sisa total detik dibagi <code>3600</code>, lalu dibagi <code>60></code> dan <em>dibulatkan ke bawah</em> <strong style="color: #dc3545;">(menit)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="a-o3" name="a-o3" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="a-o4">Sisa total detik dibagi <code>60</code> <strong style="color: #dc3545;">(detik)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="a-o4" name="a-o4" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
</fieldset>
</details>
</div>
</section>

<!-- Total Progress Hourly -->
<section role="tabpanel" id="panel-total" aria-labelledby="tab-total" hidden>
<h2>Total Progress Hourly</h2>
<div id="form-total">
<fieldset>
<legend>Input</legend>
<p><label for="t-prev">Total progress sebelumnya:</label> <input type="text" id="t-prev" name="prev" value="60 H 41 M"></p>
<p><label for="t-now">Progress saat ini:</label> <input type="text" id="t-now" name="now" value="8 H 45 M"></p>
<p><button type="button" id="reset-total">Reset</button> <button type="button" id="clear-total">Clear</button></p>
</fieldset>
<p><label for="t-out">Total Hours:</label> <textarea id="t-out" name="total-hours" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><strong>Contoh:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Total progress sebelumnya adalah <code>60 H 41 M</code></li>
<li>Progress sekarang: <code>8 H 45 M</code></li>
<li>Total Hours: <samp>69 H 26 M</samp></li>
</ul>
<details>
<summary>Perhitungan</summary>
<p><label for="t-s1">Total progress sebelumnya diubah ke menit <strong>(jam dikali 60 ditambah menit)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="t-s1" name="t-s1" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="t-s2">Progress sekarang diubah ke menit <strong>(jam dikali 60 ditambah menit)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="t-s2" name="t-s2" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="t-s3">Menit sebelumnya ditambah menit sekarang <strong>(total menit)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="t-s3" name="t-s3" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="t-s4">Total menit dibagi <code>60</code>, <em>dibulatkan ke bawah</em> <strong style="color: #dc3545;">(jam)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="t-s4" name="t-s4" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="t-s5">Sisa total menit dibagi <code>60</code> <strong style="color: #dc3545;">(menit)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="t-s5" name="t-s5" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
</details>
</div>
</section>

<!-- Buff Counter -->
<section role="tabpanel" id="panel-buff" aria-labelledby="tab-buff" hidden>
<h2>Buff Counter</h2>
<div id="form-buff">
<fieldset>
<legend>Input</legend>
<p><label for="b-shift">Durasi shift:</label> <input type="text" id="b-shift" name="shift" value="8h"></p>
<p><label for="b-duration">Durasi buff:</label> <input type="text" id="b-duration" name="duration" value="15m"></p>
<p><label for="b-cooldown">Buff cooldown:</label> <input type="text" id="b-cooldown" name="cooldown" value="10s"></p>
<p><label for="b-price">Harga per buff (opsional):</label> <input type="text" id="b-price" name="price" value="27.5m"></p>
<p><button type="button" id="reset-buff">Reset</button> <button type="button" id="clear-buff">Clear</button></p>
</fieldset>
<p><label for="b-o1">Shift:</label> <textarea id="b-o1" name="shift-out" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="b-o2">Buff:</label> <textarea id="b-o2" name="buff-out" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="b-o3">Total Buff:</label> <textarea id="b-o3" name="total-buff" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="b-o4">Harga:</label> <textarea id="b-o4" name="cost" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><strong>Note:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Jika ditulis tanpa satuan, Shift length dihitung <em>jam</em>, Buff duration <em>menit</em>, dan Cooldown <em>detik</em>, jadi <code>8 15 10</code> sama dengan <code>8h 15m 10s</code></li>
<li>Satuan yang bisa dipakai: <code>h</code>, <code>m</code>, <code>s</code>. Tiap form input hanya dapat diisi satu nilai saja tidak bisa lebih, misal tulis <code>90m</code> bukan <code>1h 30m</code></li>
<li>Price per buff bisa pakai angka biasa, pemisah ribuan, atau akhiran <code>k</code>, <code>m</code>, <code>b</code>. Jika dikosongkan, Cost tidak akan masuk perhitungan</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Contoh:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Durasi shift: <code>8h</code>, Durasi buff: <code>15m</code>, Buff cooldown: <code>10s</code>, Harga per buff: <code>27.5m</code></li>
<li>Shift: <samp>8h</samp></li>
<li>Buff: <samp>15m duration + 10s cooldown (one buff covers 15m 10s)</samp></li>
<li>Total Buff: <samp>32 buffs</samp></li>
<li>Harga: <samp>32 x 27,500,000 = 880,000,000 silver</samp></li>
</ul>
<details>
<summary>Perhitungan</summary>
<p><label for="b-s1">Shift diubah ke detik <strong>(nilai dikali satuan detik)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="b-s1" name="b-s1" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="b-s2">Durasi buff diubah ke detik <strong>(nilai dikali satuan detik)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="b-s2" name="b-s2" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="b-s3">Buff cooldown diubah ke detik <strong>(nilai dikali satuan detik)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="b-s3" name="b-s3" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="b-s4">Satu buff menutupi waktu shift sebesar durasi ditambah cooldown <strong>(siklus, dalam detik)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="b-s4" name="b-s4" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="b-s5">Shift dibagi <em>siklus</em></label></p>
<p><textarea id="b-s5" name="b-s5" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="b-s6">Hasil bagi <em>dibulatkan ke atas</em></label></p>
<p><textarea id="b-s6" name="b-s6" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="b-s7">Jumlah buff minimal 1 <strong style="color: #dc3545;">(ambil yang terbesar antara 1 dan hasil pembulatan)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="b-s7" name="b-s7" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="b-s8">Harga per buff diubah ke silver <strong>(nilai dikali pengali, dibulatkan ke bawah)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="b-s8" name="b-s8" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="b-s9">Total biaya: jumlah buff dikali harga per buff <strong style="color: #dc3545;">(silver)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="b-s9" name="b-s9" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
</details>
</div>
</section>

<!-- BDO Tax Calculator -->
<section role="tabpanel" id="panel-tax" aria-labelledby="tab-tax" hidden>
<h2>BDO Tax Calculator</h2>
<div id="form-tax">
<fieldset>
<legend>Input</legend>
<p><label for="d-price">Price:</label> <input type="text" id="d-price" name="price" value="5m"></p>
<p><label for="d-options">Options (opsional):</label> <input type="text" id="d-options" name="options" value="vp ring 4500"></p>
<p><button type="button" id="reset-tax">Reset</button> <button type="button" id="clear-tax">Clear</button></p>
</fieldset>
<p><label for="d-o1">Sale price:</label> <textarea id="d-o1" name="d-o1" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-o2">Tax (35%):</label> <textarea id="d-o2" name="d-o2" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-o3">Base profit (65%):</label> <textarea id="d-o3" name="d-o3" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-o4">Value Pack (+30%):</label> <textarea id="d-o4" name="d-o4" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-o5">Ring/Pass (+5%):</label> <textarea id="d-o5" name="d-o5" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-o6" id="d-l6">Family Fame:</label> <textarea id="d-o6" name="d-o6" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-o7">You receive:</label> <textarea id="d-o7" name="d-o7" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<fieldset id="d-out2" hidden>
<legend>with Value Pack</legend>
<p><label for="d-p1">Sale price:</label> <textarea id="d-p1" name="d-p1" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-p2">Tax (35%):</label> <textarea id="d-p2" name="d-p2" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-p3">Base profit (65%):</label> <textarea id="d-p3" name="d-p3" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-p4">Value Pack (+30%):</label> <textarea id="d-p4" name="d-p4" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-p5">You receive:</label> <textarea id="d-p5" name="d-p5" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
</fieldset>
<p><strong>Note:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Price bisa pakai angka biasa (<code>5000000</code>), pemisah ribuan (<code>1,000,000</code>), atau akhiran <code>k</code> (ribu), <code>m</code> (juta), <code>b</code> (miliar), <code>t</code> (triliun), contoh <code>500k</code>, <code>100m</code>, <code>1.5b</code></li>
<li>Options boleh dikosongkan atau diisi beberapa, dipisah spasi: <code>vp</code> (Value Pack aktif), <code>ring</code> (Rich Merchant's Ring atau Old Moon Trade Pass, keduanya tidak bisa ditumpuk), dan Family Fame berupa tier <code>fame1</code>, <code>fame2</code>, <code>fame3</code> atau poin Family Fame <em>di shortcut keyboard <strong>P</strong></em> (contoh <code>4500</code>, otomatis akan diubah menjadi tier)</li>
<li>Cara mengisi Options: tulis hanya yang aktif, yang tidak aktif tidak perlu ditulis. Contoh jika Value Pack aktif, Ring tidak aktif, dan poin Family Fame 4500, tulis <code>vp 4500</code></li>
<li>Contoh lain: Value Pack tidak aktif, Ring aktif, dan Family Fame tier 2, tulis <code>ring fame2</code>. Jika semuanya aktif, tulis <code>vp ring 4500</code>. Jika tidak ada yang aktif, kosongkan Options</li>
<li>Jika Options kosong, result akan menampilkan dua versi: biasa dan with Value Pack</li>
<li>Jika ada lebih dari satu input Family Fame, maka otomatis yang terakhir sendiri masuk ke perhitungan</li>
<li>Pajak total <em>35%</em> (30% Central Market dan 5% territory), jadi seller menerima <em>65%</em></li>
<li>Semua bonus dihitung dari profit setelah pajak <em>(65%)</em>, lalu dijumlahkan: <em>Value Pack +30%</em>, <em>Ring/Pass +5%</em>, <em>Family Fame 1000–3999 +0.5%</em>, <em>4000–6999 +1.0%</em>, <em>7000 ke atas +1.5%</em></li>
</ul>
<p>Contoh:</p>
<ul>
<li>Price: <code>100m</code>, Options dikosongkan akan menampilkan hasil dengan Value Pack</li>
<li>Price: <code>1.5b</code>, Options: <code>vp</code> menampilkan Value Pack saja</li>
<li>Price: <code>5m</code>, Options: <code>vp ring 4500</code>, poin 4500 menjadi tier +1.0%</li>
<li>Price: <code>100m</code>, Options: <code>vp ring fame3</code> menampilkan semua bonus lewat tier</li>
<li>Sale price: <samp>5,000,000</samp></li>
<li>Tax (35%): <samp>-1,750,000</samp></li>
<li>Base profit (65%): <samp>3,250,000</samp></li>
<li>Value Pack (+30%): <samp>+975,000</samp></li>
<li>Ring/Pass (+5%): <samp>+162,500</samp></li>
<li>Family Fame (4,500 pts, +1.0%): <samp>+32,500</samp></li>
<li>You receive: <samp>4,420,000 (88.40%)</samp></li>
</ul>
<details>
<summary>Perhitungan</summary>
<p><label for="d-s1">Harga diubah ke silver <strong>(nilai dikali pengali, dibulatkan ke bawah)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="d-s1" name="d-s1" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-s2">Profit setelah pajak: harga dikali <code>0.65</code></label></p>
<p><textarea id="d-s2" name="d-s2" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-s3">Pajak: harga dikurangi profit</label></p>
<p><textarea id="d-s3" name="d-s3" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-s4">Bonus Value Pack: profit dikali <code>0.3</code></label></p>
<p><textarea id="d-s4" name="d-s4" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-s5">Bonus Ring/Pass: profit dikali <code>0.05</code></label></p>
<p><textarea id="d-s5" name="d-s5" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-s6">Family Fame points dibandingkan dengan batas tier</label></p>
<p><textarea id="d-s6" name="d-s6" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-s7">Bonus Family Fame: profit dikali persen tier</label></p>
<p><textarea id="d-s7" name="d-s7" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-s8">Total diterima: profit ditambah semua bonus</label></p>
<p><textarea id="d-s8" name="d-s8" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-s9">Rate efektif: total dibagi harga</label></p>
<p><textarea id="d-s9" name="d-s9" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-s10">Rate dalam persen: rate dikali <code>100</code></label></p>
<p><textarea id="d-s10" name="d-s10" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<fieldset id="d-stp2" hidden>
<legend>with Value Pack</legend>
<p><label for="d-t1">Profit setelah pajak: harga dikali <code>0.65</code></label></p>
<p><textarea id="d-t1" name="d-t1" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-t2">Pajak: harga dikurangi profit</label></p>
<p><textarea id="d-t2" name="d-t2" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-t3">Bonus Value Pack: profit dikali <code>0.3</code></label></p>
<p><textarea id="d-t3" name="d-t3" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-t4">Total diterima: profit ditambah semua bonus</label></p>
<p><textarea id="d-t4" name="d-t4" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-t5">Rate efektif: total dibagi harga</label></p>
<p><textarea id="d-t5" name="d-t5" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="d-t6">Rate dalam persen: rate dikali <code>100</code></label></p>
<p><textarea id="d-t6" name="d-t6" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
</fieldset>
</details>
</div>  
</section>

<!-- Total TL -->
<section role="tabpanel" id="panel-totaltl" aria-labelledby="tab-totaltl" hidden>
<h2>Total TL</h2>
<div id="form-totaltl">
<fieldset>
<legend>Input</legend>
<p><label for="tl-start">TL awal:</label> <input type="text" inputmode="decimal" id="tl-start" name="start" value="325,000"></p>
<p><label for="tl-end">TL akhir:</label> <input type="text" inputmode="decimal" id="tl-end" name="end" value="410,000"></p>
<p><button type="button" id="reset-totaltl">Reset</button> <button type="button" id="clear-totaltl">Clear</button></p>
</fieldset>
<p><label for="tl-out">Total perolehan TL:</label> <textarea id="tl-out" name="total-tl" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><strong>Note:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Total TL ini fungsinya untuk mengetahui total perolehan TL jika di storage sudah ada TL-nya</li>
<li><em>TL awal</em> adalah TL yang sudah ada di storage</li>
<li><em>TL akhir</em> adalah TL setelah grinding selama shift yang sudah ditaruh di storage</li>
<li>Total perolehan TL didapat dari TL akhir dikurangi TL awal</li>
</ul>
<p>Contoh:</p>
<ul>
<li>TL awal: <code>325,000</code></li>
<li>TL akhir: <code>410,000</code></li>
<li>Total perolehan TL: <samp>85,000</samp></li>
</ul>
<details>
<summary>Perhitungan</summary>
<p><label for="tl-s1">TL akhir dikurangi TL awal <strong>(total perolehan TL)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="tl-s1" name="tl-s1" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
</details>
</div>
</section>

<!-- Compen -->
<section role="tabpanel" id="panel-compen" aria-labelledby="tab-compen" hidden>
<h2>Compen</h2>
<div id="form-compen">
<fieldset>
<legend>Input</legend>
<p><label for="cp-compen">Compen berapa silver?</label> <input type="text" id="cp-compen" name="compen" value="3b"></p>
<p><label for="cp-price">Harga TL (opsional):</label> <input type="text" id="cp-price" name="price" value="181,042"></p>
<p><label for="cp-pct">Persen TL:</label> <input type="range" id="cp-pct" name="pct" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="50"></p>
<p><button type="button" id="reset-compen">Reset</button> <button type="button" id="clear-compen">Clear</button></p>
</fieldset>
<p><label for="cp-o1">Compen:</label> <textarea id="cp-o1" name="cp-o1" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<fieldset id="cp-tl">
<legend>TL</legend>
<p><label for="cp-o2">Persen:</label> <textarea id="cp-o2" name="cp-o2" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="cp-o3">Silver:</label> <textarea id="cp-o3" name="cp-o3" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="cp-o4">Jumlah TL yang harus disell:</label> <textarea id="cp-o4" name="cp-o4" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
</fieldset>
<fieldset id="cp-rng">
<legend>RNG</legend>
<p><label for="cp-o5">Persen:</label> <textarea id="cp-o5" name="cp-o5" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="cp-o6">Silver:</label> <textarea id="cp-o6" name="cp-o6" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
</fieldset>
<p><strong>Note:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Compen bisa diisi angka biasa, pemisah ribuan, atau akhiran <code>k</code>, <code>m</code>, <code>b</code>, contoh <code>500k</code>, <code>100m</code>, <code>3b</code></li>
<li>Harga TL adalah harga satu TL dalam silver, bisa diisi dengan format yang sama. Jika dikosongkan, Jumlah TL yang harus disell tidak akan dihitung</li>
<li>Slider Persen TL mengatur pembagian compen antara <em>TL</em> dan <em>RNG</em>: paling kiri <em>0%</em> TL (semuanya RNG) dan paling kanan <em>100%</em> TL (semuanya TL), misal <em>40%</em> TL berarti <em>60%</em> RNG</li>
<li>Jumlah TL yang harus disell <em>dibulatkan ke atas</em> supaya silver dari TL mencapai bagian compen TL</li>
<li>Sisa compen di luar bagian TL adalah bagian dari <em>RNG</em></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Contoh:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Misal yang pecah <em>Corrupted Glutony Crystal</em>, harga di central market sekarang adalah <code>3b</code> dan patokan compen yang digunakan adalah <em>50%</em> RNG dan <em>50%</em> TL</li>
<li>Grind di Magaia, harga TL-nya <code>181,042</code></li>
<li>Compen: <code>3b</code>, Harga TL: <code>181,042</code>, Persen TL: <code>50%</code></li>
<li>Compen: <samp>3,000,000,000 silver</samp></li>
<li>TL, Persen: <samp>50%</samp></li>
<li>TL, Silver: <samp>1,500,000,000 silver</samp></li>
<li>TL, Jumlah TL yang harus disell: <samp>8,286 TL</samp></li>
<li>RNG, Persen: <samp>50%</samp></li>
<li>RNG, Silver: <samp>1,500,000,000 silver</samp></li>
</ul>
<details>
<summary>Perhitungan</summary>
<p><label for="cp-s1">Compen diubah ke silver <strong>(nilai dikali pengali, dibulatkan ke bawah)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="cp-s1" name="cp-s1" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="cp-s2">Harga TL diubah ke silver <strong>(nilai dikali pengali, dibulatkan ke bawah)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="cp-s2" name="cp-s2" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="cp-s3">Compen TL: compen dikali persen TL, dibagi <code>100</code> <strong>(dibulatkan ke bawah)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="cp-s3" name="cp-s3" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="cp-s4">Compen RNG: compen dikurangi compen TL</label></p>
<p><textarea id="cp-s4" name="cp-s4" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="cp-s5">Jumlah TL: compen TL dibagi harga TL <strong style="color: #dc3545;">(dibulatkan ke atas)</strong></label></p>
<p><textarea id="cp-s5" name="cp-s5" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="cp-s6">Total silver dari TL: jumlah TL dikali harga TL</label></p>
<p><textarea id="cp-s6" name="cp-s6" rows="1" cols="50" readonly></textarea></p>
</details>
</div>
</section>

<!-- Silver -->
<section role="tabpanel" id="panel-silver" aria-labelledby="tab-silver" hidden>
<h2>Silver</h2>
<div id="form-silver">
<fieldset>
<legend>Input</legend>
<fieldset>
<legend>Awal shift</legend>
<p><label for="sv-c0">Silver di Central Market:</label> <input type="text" id="sv-c0" name="c0" value="120b"></p>
<p><label><input type="checkbox" id="sv-i0-on" name="sv-i0-on" aria-controls="sv-i0"> Silver di Inventory (opsional):</label> <input type="text" id="sv-i0" name="i0" value="5b" disabled aria-label="Silver di Inventory (opsional, screenshot awal)"></p>
</fieldset>
<fieldset>
<legend>TL & RNG</legend>
<p><label><input type="checkbox" id="sv-o1-on" name="sv-o1-on" aria-controls="sv-o1"> Sell in storage:</label> <input type="text" id="sv-o1" name="o1" value="7.6b" disabled aria-label="Sell in storage"></p>
<p><label><input type="checkbox" id="sv-o2-on" name="sv-o2-on" aria-controls="sv-o2"> Sell in Central Market:</label> <input type="text" id="sv-o2" name="o2" value="3.7b" disabled aria-label="Sell in Central Market"></p>
<p><label><input type="checkbox" id="sv-o3-on" name="sv-o3-on" aria-controls="sv-o3"> Listed in CM (Tax):</label> <input type="text" id="sv-o3" name="o3" value="1.3b" disabled aria-label="Listed in CM (Tax)"></p>
<p><label><input type="checkbox" id="sv-o4-on" name="sv-o4-on" aria-controls="sv-o4"> Keep owner:</label> <input type="text" id="sv-o4" name="o4" value="2.1b" disabled aria-label="Keep owner"></p>
</fieldset>
<fieldset>
<legend>End shift</legend>
<p><label for="sv-c1">Silver di Central Market:</label> <input type="text" id="sv-c1" name="c1" value="118b"></p>
<p><label><input type="checkbox" id="sv-i1-on" name="sv-i1-on" aria-controls="sv-i1"> Silver di Inventory (opsional):</label> <input type="text" id="sv-i1" name="i1" value="2.5b" disabled aria-label="Silver di Inventory (opsional, screenshot akhir)"></p>
</fieldset>
<fieldset>
<legend>Total Progress</legend>
<p><label for="sv-p0">Total progress sebelumnya (opsional):</label> <input type="text" id="sv-p0" name="p0" value="59.4b"></p>
<p><label for="sv-p1">Total progress seluruhnya:</label> <input type="text" id="sv-p1" name="p1" value="150b"></p>
</fieldset>
<p><button type="button" id="reset-silver">Reset</button> <button type="button" id="clear-silver">Clear</button></p>
</fieldset>
<fieldset id="sv-cmp">
<legend>Perbandingan silver (Awal dan akhir shift)</legend>
<p><label for="sv-r1">Awal shift:</label> <textarea id="sv-r1" name="sv-r1" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="sv-r2">End shift:</label> <textarea id="sv-r2" name="sv-r2" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="sv-r3">Selisih:</label> <textarea id="sv-r3" name="sv-r3" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="sv-r4">Keterangan:</label> <textarea id="sv-r4" name="sv-r4" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
</fieldset>
<p><label for="sv-r5">Total perolehan silver:</label> <textarea id="sv-r5" name="sv-r5" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><label for="sv-r6">Total Progress:</label> <textarea id="sv-r6" name="sv-r6" rows="1" cols="40" readonly></textarea></p>
<p><strong>Note:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Silver di Central Market <em>(awal dan akhir shift)</em> wajib diisi. Silver di Inventory (opsional) bisa diisi jika ada silvernya, dan semua opsi TL & RNG boleh dicentang atau tidak: jika dicentang, kolomnya aktif, jika tidak, kolomnya nonaktif dan otomatis akan dihitung <code>0</code></li>
<li>Silver bisa diisi angka biasa, pemisah ribuan, atau akhiran <code>k</code>, <code>m</code>, <code>b</code>, contoh <code>500k</code>, <code>100m</code>, <code>1.5b</code></li>
<li>Silver pada awal dan end shift dijumlahkan dari Central Market dan Inventory, jadi <em>perpindahan silver antara keduanya tidak akan memengaruhi hasil</em></li>
<li>Perbandingan silver di CM menampilkan silver pada saat awal shift, end shift, dan selisihnya: <em>hijau</em> jika bertambah dan <em>merah</em> jika berkurang. Berkurang itu wajar karena ada biaya saat atau sebelum grinding, seperti repair gear dan beli buff. Jika silver bertambah perlu dicek karena bisa jadi ada aktivitas di luar grinding <em>(wajib tanyakan owner)</em>, yang ikut menambah total perolehan silver</li>
<li>Total perolehan silver adalah <em>selisih</em> ditambah total <em>TL & RNG</em></li>
<li><em>Awal shift dan end shift beda banget dengan screenshot awal dan akhir, jangan menginput awal shift dengan screenshot awal dan end shift dengan screenshot akhir biar perhitungannya akurat</em></li>
<li>Total Progress adalah total progress sebelumnya ditambah total perolehan silver saat ini, dibandingkan dengan total progress seluruhnya. Formatnya <code>57.4 B / 150 B</code>: kiri progress yang didapat, kanan total progress seluruhnya. <code>B</code> berarti miliar, <code>M</code> juta, dan <code>K</code> ribu</li>
<li>Total progress sebelumnya boleh dikosongkan, otomatis akan dihitung <code>0</code></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Contoh:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Central Market (awal shift): <code>120b</code>, Central Market (end shift): <code>118b</code></li>
<li>Total progress sebelumnya: <code>59.4b</code>, Total progress seluruhnya: <code>150b</code></li>
<li>Selisih: <samp>-2,000,000,000 silver (-2 B)</samp> (merah karena berkurang)</li>
<li>Total perolehan silver: <samp>-2,000,000,000 silver (-2 B)</samp></li>
<li>Total Progress: <samp>57.4 B / 140 B</samp></li>
<li>Jika <em>Sell in storage</em> dicentang dan diisi <code>7.6b</code>, Total perolehan silver menjadi <samp>5,600,000,000 silver (5.6 B)</samp> dan Total Progress <samp>65 B / 150 B</samp></li>
<li>Jika Central Market (end shift) <code>118b</code>, Selisih <samp>-2,000,000,000 silver (-2 B)</samp> (merah karena berkurang)</li>
</ul>
<details>
<summary>Perhitungan</summary>
<p><label for="sv-s1">Silver awal: silver Central Market ditambah silver Inventory <strong>(jika dicentang)</strong></label></p>
